Monolayer BN - MF/Epsilon
=========================

In this directory we perform a non-self-consistent (NSCF) mean-field
calculation to generate all of the Bloch states needed for the subsequent
GW/GW-BSE calculations. The resulting wavefunction file will then be read
as WFN by the Epsilon code.


Instructions
------------

  1. Run ``./01-calculate_wfn.qsub`` to start the calculation of wave
     functions, charge density matrix and exchange-correllation matrix
     elements. This step should take 3 mins.

  2. Look at the Octopus input file ``inp``. What changed with respect to the
     input file for the scf calculation? How many empty states are we
     generating?
